<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11593" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπαστ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατέομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not having eaten, abstaining from food, fasting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.346
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				563a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				57
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				168
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπαστος ἐδητύος ἠδὲ ποτῆτος</span>
			<i>without having tasted</i> meat or drink, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.788
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.250
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				200
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδητύος ἔργον ἄπαστον</span>
			a meal <i>which feeds not,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.250
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>not eaten,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				11.16
			</span></i>.</div>
